  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
        <h1>Clear prices, <em>fixed before we start.</em></h1>
        <ul class="pr-answer" aria-label="The short answer">
          <li><span>A first project</span><b><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span> to <span data-zar="45000">R45,000</span></b><small>once-off</small></li>
          <li><span>A whole process, in stages</span><b><span data-zar="50000">R50,000</span> to <span data-zar="150000">R150,000</span></b><small>stop after any stage</small></li>
          <li><span>Keeping it running</span><b>from <span data-zar="1450">R1,450</span></b><small>a month</small></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="cur-line">Prices in <span class="cur-pick" role="group" aria-label="Show prices in"><button type="button" data-cur="ZAR" aria-pressed="true">ZAR</button><button type="button" data-cur="USD" aria-pressed="false">USD</button><button type="button" data-cur="EUR" aria-pressed="false">EUR</button><button type="button" data-cur="GBP" aria-pressed="false">GBP</button></span></p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" class="btn btn--primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-pricing-book-top">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="#roi" class="btn btn--ghost" data-track="cta-pricing-roi">Work out what it&rsquo;s worth to you</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRICES -->
    <section class="section" id="starting" aria-labelledby="startTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Prices</span>
          <h2 id="startTitle">What things cost.</h2>
          <p>Starting prices. Your quote fixes the exact price before any work starts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glance reveal">
          <div class="price-group" id="websites">
            <h3>One-off work</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">One problem, one fixed price.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><a href="ai-demos">AI that reads and replies<small>Emails answered, or answers found in your documents</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="ai-for-business#library">An automation<small>One task your team types by hand, done for them</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#dashboards">A dashboard<small>Your numbers on one screen, always up to date</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#software">Connecting your systems<small>Nothing typed in twice</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="45000">R45,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#websites">A business website<small>Found on Google, enquiries straight to you</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="services#websites">Website with bookings or payments<small>Customers book or pay without calling you</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="price-group" id="implementation">
            <h3>Bigger processes, in stages</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">You decide after each stage.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><span class="pl-name">Free review<small>30 minutes: is AI the answer?</small></span><span class="price">Free</span></li>
              <li><a href="method#steps">1 · Find<small>We measure the work, 1&ndash;2 weeks. Credited if you go ahead.</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="method#steps">2 · Prove<small>A small version on your real work, 2&ndash;4 weeks</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="method#steps">3 · Build<small>The full version, connected and your team trained</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="85000">R85,000</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="price-group" id="care">
            <h3>Monthly</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">To keep it running. 3-month minimum on AI plans.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li class="pl-sub">For a website</li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Hosting<small>Online, secure and backed up</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="450">R450</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Care<small>Hosting, plus an hour of changes a month</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="1450">R1,450</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li class="pl-sub">For AI</li>
              <li><a href="#operations">Operate<small>We look after one AI system</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="#operations">Optimise<small>Up to three, improved every month</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
              <li><a href="#operations">Partner<small>All of them, priority replies</small></a><span class="price"><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span><span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="pr-assure reveal" aria-label="How paying works">
          <li><b>40% deposit</b>, the rest when it&rsquo;s done</li>
          <li><b>Card or EFT</b></li>
          <li><b>Monthly plans</b> charged automatically</li>
          <li><b>Stop after any stage</b></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ ROI CALCULATOR ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="roi" aria-labelledby="roiTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Is it worth it?</span>
          <h2 id="roiTitle">What is that work costing you?</h2>
          <p>A rough estimate in ten seconds. For example, a 40-person firm spends <span data-zar="120000">R120,000</span> and gets about 208 hours a month back: paid off in about <span data-payback>3</span> months.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="roi reveal" data-roi>
          <div class="roi__inputs">
            <label class="roi__field"><span>People doing this work</span><output data-roi-out="people">3</output><input type="range" name="people" min="1" max="50" value="3" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Hours each spends on it per week</span><output data-roi-out="hours">5</output><input type="range" name="hours" min="1" max="40" value="5" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Their monthly salary (<span data-cur-code>ZAR</span>)</span><output data-roi-out="salary">R25,000</output><input type="range" name="salary" min="8000" max="120000" step="1000" value="25000" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Share of that work a system could take over</span><output data-roi-out="share">60%</output><input type="range" name="share" min="20" max="90" step="5" value="60" /></label>
          </div>
          <div class="roi__out" aria-live="polite">
            <p class="roi__loss">Right now about <b data-roi="month2">R0</b> a month goes on work a system could do.</p>
            <div><span>Hours a month that could come back</span><b data-roi="hours">0</b></div>
            <div><span>What that time costs you, per month</span><b data-roi="month">R0</b></div>
            <div class="roi__big"><span>Per year</span><b data-roi="year">R0</b></div>
            <p class="tiny muted">A rough guide from your numbers. We measure the real figure first.</p>
            <a class="btn btn--primary btn--full" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-roi-book">Book a free call to talk it through</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form class="sendme reveal" data-sendme="roi" novalidate>
          <p class="sendme__t">Keep this estimate? We&rsquo;ll email you the numbers.</p>
          <div class="sendme__row">
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" aria-label="Your email address" />
            <input type="text" name="business" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Business (optional)" aria-label="Business name (optional)" />
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--small">Email it to me</button>
          </div>
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0" />
          <p class="tiny muted sendme__msg" data-sendme-msg aria-live="polite">We&rsquo;ll send it once and may follow up once. <a class="inline-link" href="privacy">Privacy</a></p>
        </form>
        <details class="fold reveal">
          <summary><span>Worked example</span> <span data-zar="120000">R120,000</span> to build · ~208 hours back a month · paid back in ~<span data-payback-x>3.3</span> months</summary>
          <div class="fold__body">
            <p class="small muted">Example numbers for enquiry handling. We measure yours first.</p>
        <div class="ex">
              <table class="spec">
                <caption>Cost</caption>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>Find</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Prove</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Build</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="85000">R85,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Find fee credited back</td><td class="price">−<span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Total to build</strong></td><td class="price"><strong><span data-zar="120000">R120,000</span></strong></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Monthly (Operate)</td><td class="price"><span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
              <table class="spec">
                <caption>Value</caption>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>8 people × 10 hours a week on enquiries</td><td class="price">346 h/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Share the system takes over (measured)</td><td class="price">60%</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Hours back</td><td class="price">208 h/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>At <span data-ex="salary">R28,000</span> salary (≈ <span data-ex="hourly">R210</span>/h)</td><td class="price"><span data-ex="value">R43,730</span>/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Less the monthly fee</td><td class="price">−<span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Payback</strong></td><td class="price"><strong>≈ <span data-payback-x>3.3</span> months</strong></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="small muted">Hours back × what those people cost you. Extra sales are counted only when measured.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OPERATIONS -->
    <section class="section" id="operations" aria-labelledby="opsTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">After launch</span>
          <h2 id="opsTitle">Kept running, every month.</h2>
          <p>We watch it, fix it, keep it accurate, and send you the time saved every month. 3-month minimum, then month to month.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid plans plans--3">
          <div class="card plan reveal">
            <h3>Operate</h3>
            <div class="plan__price"><span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span><small>/month</small></div>
            <p>One system, looked after.</p>
            <ul><li>1 system</li><li>AI running costs included, up to <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span>/month</li><li>2 hours of improvements a month</li><li>Reply by the next business day</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan plan--featured reveal">
            <span class="plan__flag">Most chosen</span>
            <h3>Optimise</h3>
            <div class="plan__price"><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span><small>/month</small></div>
            <p>A few systems, improved monthly.</p>
            <ul><li>Up to 3 systems</li><li>AI running costs included, up to <span data-zar="4000">R4,000</span>/month</li><li>6 hours of improvements a month</li><li>Reply the same business day</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan reveal">
            <h3>Partner</h3>
            <div class="plan__price"><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span><small>/month</small></div>
            <p>Everything, priority replies. A few places only.</p>
            <ul><li>All your systems</li><li>AI running costs included, up to <span data-zar="10000">R10,000</span>/month</li><li>15 hours of improvements a month</li><li>Reply within 4 business hours</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="center small muted section__foot reveal">AI running costs are what the AI company charges per use. Above your plan&rsquo;s amount you pay just that, with a warning at 80%.</p>

        <details class="fold reveal" id="sla">
          <summary><span>Reply times</span> How fast we respond on each plan</summary>
          <div class="fold__body">
            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="spec spec--sla">
                <caption>Reply times</caption>
                <thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">Operate</th><th scope="col">Optimise</th><th scope="col">Partner</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Critical: down, or wrong results at scale</th><td>Next business day</td><td>Same business day</td><td>4 business hours</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">High: a part failing, with a workaround</th><td>2 business days</td><td>Next business day</td><td>Same business day</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Normal: questions and requests</th><td>3 business days</td><td>2 business days</td><td>Next business day</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Monitoring &amp; alerts</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Security updates &amp; maintenance</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
                  <tr><th scope="row">Accuracy check</th><td>Quarterly</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Monthly</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="small muted">Business hours are Monday to Friday, 08:00–17:00 SAST, excluding public holidays. Response time is a person acknowledging the issue with a first assessment, not a guaranteed fix time. We monitor the AI providers we use but can&rsquo;t guarantee their uptime; we guarantee how fast we respond and that your system falls back safely.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OTHER COSTS (folded) -->
    <section class="section section--tint section--slim" id="separate" aria-label="Other costs">
      <div class="container">
        <details class="fold reveal">
          <summary><span>Other costs</span> Extra hours, workshops, after-hours help, and costs we pass on</summary>
          <div class="fold__body">
            <div class="glance glance--2">
          <div class="price-group">
            <h3>Priced separately</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">Agreed first.</p>
            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span class="pl-name">Changes<small>Beyond your plan&rsquo;s hours</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="1250">R1,250</span><span class="per">/hour</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">New features<small>Their own fixed quote</small></span><span class="price">Quoted</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Advice &amp; workshops<small>Half-day <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span></small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="1850">R1,850</span><span class="per">/hour</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Emergency support<small>Outside business hours, by arrangement, 1-hour minimum</small></span><span class="price"><span data-zar="2450">R2,450</span><span class="per">/hour</span></span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="price-group" id="ongoing">
            <h3>Passed through at cost</h3>
            <p class="glance__sub">Never marked up.</p>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><span class="pl-name">Other software<small>Tools you choose to use</small></span><span class="price">At cost</span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">AI running costs<small>Above your plan&rsquo;s amount: what the AI company charges</small></span><span class="price">At cost</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="pricingFaqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pricing questions</span>
          <h2 id="pricingFaqTitle">Questions.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item" id="process"><summary>How does a project work?</summary><ol class="faq__steps"><li><b>Tell us the problem.</b></li><li><b>Get a fixed quote.</b> Accept it and pay a 40% deposit.</li><li><b>We build, you review.</b></li><li><b>Pay the balance; it goes live.</b> You own it.</li></ol></details>
          <details class="faq__item" id="cost"><summary>What changes the price?</summary><p>How much it does, how many systems it connects to, and whether your information needs tidying first.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can we stop part-way?</summary><p>Yes, after any step. If the small version doesn&rsquo;t save enough time, we&rsquo;ll say so and you stop there.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Why a monthly fee?</summary><p>AI tools drift and the services they use change. The fee keeps it accurate, fixed and improving, and shows you the time saved.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do you build websites?</summary><p>Yes: from <span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span>, or <span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span> with bookings or payments.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="pricingCtaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <h2 id="pricingCtaTitle">Have a question before committing?</h2>
        <p>Ask it. Tell us what you&rsquo;re trying to improve and we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly what it would cost, including the ongoing part.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-pricing-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="cta__alt">Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in a few lines</button></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
